{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01265",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.91,
      "end_seconds": 3.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Right then, come on in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 3.68,
      "end_seconds": 6.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.33,
      "end_seconds": 13.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "Yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit. Have you been waiting long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.43,
      "end_seconds": 18.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Oh, only about ten minutes, no trouble."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.96,
      "end_seconds": 22.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "How are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 24.56,
      "end_seconds": 29.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Doctor, it's bloating after meals. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.04,
      "end_seconds": 33.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.8,
      "end_seconds": 47.7,
      "duration_seconds": 12.9,
      "text": "Escitalopram. I take it 10 milligrams, once a day. Bisoprolol. I take it 2.5 milligrams, once a day for the heart rhythm. It's peppermint capsules, after meals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.75,
      "end_seconds": 51.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.77,
      "end_seconds": 59.09,
      "duration_seconds": 6.32,
      "text": "Two years now. I was on apixaban before. I stopped taking it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.7,
      "end_seconds": 62.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.36,
      "end_seconds": 68.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "I mean, uh, it's been like this since yesterday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.62,
      "end_seconds": 75.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.91,
      "end_seconds": 92.33,
      "duration_seconds": 16.42,
      "text": "It's worse with fizzy drinks and large meals. Only walking, and it's not much. A seven out of ten, I suppose. Loose stools now and then was there, but it's gone away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.45,
      "end_seconds": 100.07,
      "duration_seconds": 6.62,
      "text": "So, have you had bloating after meals before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.02,
      "end_seconds": 106.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.9,
      "text": "I had a similar thing about six months ago. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.02,
      "end_seconds": 111.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Have you had weight loss, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.29,
      "end_seconds": 115.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Definitely no weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.14,
      "end_seconds": 120.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Any blood in the stool, night-time diarrhoea or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.46,
      "end_seconds": 125.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.26,
      "end_seconds": 130.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.99,
      "end_seconds": 133.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Nothing odd there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.54,
      "end_seconds": 136.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.31,
      "end_seconds": 143.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "Mm, uh, that's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.2,
      "end_seconds": 147.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.81,
      "end_seconds": 151.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.3,
      "end_seconds": 153.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.77,
      "end_seconds": 161.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.75,
      "end_seconds": 179.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.84,
      "end_seconds": 183.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "My grandmother had dementia."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.59,
      "end_seconds": 189.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.97,
      "end_seconds": 195.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Yes, plasters, it gives me a red itchy rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.31,
      "end_seconds": 200.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.09,
      "end_seconds": 210.84,
      "duration_seconds": 8.75,
      "text": "I have anxiety, for five years. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. I have an irregular heartbeat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.77,
      "end_seconds": 221.18,
      "duration_seconds": 8.41,
      "text": "Okay, I can see an irregular heartbeat in your file as well. What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.79,
      "end_seconds": 227.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "I had a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.72,
      "end_seconds": 241.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.64,
      "end_seconds": 250.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.66,
      "end_seconds": 266.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 128 over 80, pulse 77."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.52,
      "end_seconds": 273.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.02,
      "end_seconds": 276.99,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.24,
      "end_seconds": 280.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.33,
      "end_seconds": 295.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft and not tender, and I can't feel any lumps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.29,
      "end_seconds": 311.75,
      "duration_seconds": 10.46,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. Let me tell you where I've got to. It fits best with a functional bowel pattern, with no alarm features."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.22,
      "end_seconds": 339.71,
      "duration_seconds": 15.49,
      "text": "I'm sending you for a coeliac blood test because of bloating. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. Please come and see me in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.64,
      "end_seconds": 346.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Well, um, I'll book it on my way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.78,
      "end_seconds": 349.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "So, that's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 351.03,
      "end_seconds": 353.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    }
  ]
}